message: "If you use SARC-DQ, please cite it as below."
title: "SARC-DQ: Runtime Data-Quality Gating for Agentic AI"
authors:
  - family-names: Besanson
    given-names: Gaston
    affiliation: "Universidad Torcuato Di Tella"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/besanson/dqsarc"
keywords:
  - data-quality
  - agentic-ai
  - governance
  - sarc
  - provenance
  - freshness
abstract: >
  SARC-DQ is the data-quality pillar of the SARC governance-by-architecture
  research program. It provides a data-quality predicate family and a Pre-Action
  Gate that wraps agent retrieval with downstream-only remediation, and GIGO-Bench,
  a seeded benchmark measuring how injected data corruption converts into agent
  action defects and financial loss across mitigation strategies.
